    it has the soybean as one of its hosts, and its appearance depends on multiple

    enviromental variables. This paper proposes using state-of-the-art machine-

    learning models for predicting the severity of Asian rust on soybean crops. We

    combine geological and meteorological data with datasets on soybean crops to

    obtain a dataset that enables better exploring the capabilities of the models.
