    Abstract. Spatial division multiplexing elastic optical networks (SDM-EON)

    using multicore fibers (MCF) are promising candidates for the future transport

    networks. In MCFs, a new dimension is added to the resource allocation pro-

    blem: core allocation. In this paper, a machine learning algorithm for core

    allocation(AMN)inSDM-EONsisproposed. Comparedwithothersolutionsin

    the literature and a scenario with a low crosstalk level, AMN achieves at least

    25.35%gainintermsofrequestblockingprobability(RBP)andatleast24.81%

    for blocked data ratio (BDR). In a scenario with a high crosstalk level, AMN

    achievesatleast8.16%gainforRBPandatleast9.28%forBDR.

